# Testing & Replay

## When tests are required

- New feature or bugfix: add/update tests **with** the implementation
- Prefer test-first; hotfix may follow up in next commit with note in SPEC

## Golden / replay case

Path: `eval/golden_cases/<feature>/<id>.json`

Minimum fields:
```json
{
  "id": "FEATURE-001",
  "risk_type": "happy_path",
  "input": {},
  "expected_output": {},
  "replay_required": true
}
```

`risk_type`: `happy_path` | `failure` | `edge` | `hallucination` | `jailbreak`

## Protection

- Do not delete existing golden cases
- Changing `expected_output` is a breaking change — flag for review

## Commands

Use `project.config.yaml` → `commands.test`. Report pass/fail in checklist.
